WEBVTT

00:02:02.800 --> 00:02:03.890
Uh, come in.

00:02:04.760 --> 00:02:07.060
How are ya, masochistic kitten?

00:02:07.880 --> 00:02:09.050
Kou-kun?

00:02:10.170 --> 00:02:11.250
What brings you here?

00:02:11.250 --> 00:02:14.110
Ta-da! A present.

00:02:15.280 --> 00:02:16.800
What's this for?

00:02:16.800 --> 00:02:20.260
It's a symbol of our friendship. Here, it's yours!

00:02:20.260 --> 00:02:22.210
Th-Thank you.

00:02:25.350 --> 00:02:26.500
They smell so nice.

00:02:26.930 --> 00:02:27.750
You like them?

00:02:27.750 --> 00:02:29.790
Yes, they're beautiful.

00:02:29.790 --> 00:02:32.000
Good! So then...

00:02:32.700 --> 00:02:35.090
You'll show me your gratitude, right?

00:02:36.290 --> 00:02:40.340
Do you really think you can get something 
without giving anything in return?

00:02:45.330 --> 00:02:48.470
It's a give-and-take world, you know.

00:02:50.360 --> 00:02:51.170
No...

00:02:53.020 --> 00:02:54.120
No!

00:02:58.510 --> 00:03:00.980
Um, s-sorry...

00:03:00.150 --> 00:03:02.250
God, what a pain.

00:03:04.460 --> 00:03:07.700
This is the thanks I get for being nice.

00:03:08.640 --> 00:03:13.120
So you just take and won't give? 
Who the hell do you think you are?

00:03:13.980 --> 00:03:15.730
I didn't mean to...

00:03:15.730 --> 00:03:16.960
Then give them back!

00:03:17.550 --> 00:03:19.210
You don't need them anymore, right?

00:03:19.210 --> 00:03:23.050
Since you won't give me anything.

00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:29.230
Since they're mine, I can tear 
them to pieces just like this.

00:03:30.850 --> 00:03:34.860
That's my right!

00:03:36.680 --> 00:03:41.620
I give you one friendly look, 
and you get all delusional.

00:03:43.390 --> 00:03:45.570
Would you please...

00:03:46.550 --> 00:03:49.580
stop pissing me off so much?

00:03:50.360 --> 00:03:52.460
No! No...

00:04:01.070 --> 00:04:02.300
What is this?

00:04:06.150 --> 00:04:08.310
I could get used to this.

00:04:18.560 --> 00:04:20.320
I won't kill you.

00:04:21.950 --> 00:04:24.520
Not until I become Adam.

00:05:23.130 --> 00:05:24.270
Eve.

00:05:28.280 --> 00:05:29.850
U-Um...

00:05:29.850 --> 00:05:31.510
Where's Kou-kun?

00:05:31.510 --> 00:05:33.270
You need him for something?

00:05:33.550 --> 00:05:36.100
Uh, no, it's nothing like that...

00:05:36.100 --> 00:05:38.350
Kou is at work right now.

00:05:38.590 --> 00:05:39.890
Work?

00:05:39.890 --> 00:05:44.590
Eve, are you concerned about Kou?

00:05:44.590 --> 00:05:49.220
No, I was just wondering where he is, 
since I haven't seen him around.

00:06:03.170 --> 00:06:06.720
I wonder what his "work" is.

00:06:31.610 --> 00:06:32.740
Kou-kun.

00:06:34.020 --> 00:06:36.870
Oh, masochistic kitten. Perfect timing.

00:06:37.360 --> 00:06:39.120
Come with me to my room.

00:06:42.910 --> 00:06:44.290
Come in.

00:06:47.480 --> 00:06:50.180
Man, this really sucks.

00:06:50.180 --> 00:06:51.850
U-Um...

00:06:51.850 --> 00:06:54.080
Come help me change.

00:06:54.930 --> 00:06:57.470
I'm not good with buttons.

00:07:00.040 --> 00:07:03.330
Hurry up! It's wet.

00:07:03.330 --> 00:07:04.690
O-Okay.

00:07:08.240 --> 00:07:09.700
Hey, Kou-kun...

00:07:10.610 --> 00:07:13.330
The other guys said that you were at work.

00:07:13.330 --> 00:07:14.180
Yeah.

00:07:15.100 --> 00:07:16.700
What kind of work is it?

00:07:20.670 --> 00:07:23.960
You really are clueless,
aren't you, masochistic kitten?

00:07:26.180 --> 00:07:28.170
I work as an idol.

00:07:29.190 --> 00:07:30.300
An idol?

00:07:30.300 --> 00:07:33.800
Yep. Thanks for doing the buttons.

00:07:37.210 --> 00:07:39.250
Kou-kun... Those scars...

00:07:40.640 --> 00:07:41.920
Oh, these?

00:07:42.600 --> 00:07:44.190
Are you curious?

00:07:44.440 --> 00:07:47.140
Then let me tell you a fairy tale.

00:07:48.070 --> 00:07:51.900
It's about a boy who was alone since birth.

00:07:53.060 --> 00:07:58.170
Once upon a time, there was a boy
who'd lived in the filthy sewers

00:07:58.170 --> 00:08:00.250
for as long as he could remember.

00:08:01.170 --> 00:08:06.150
Having never seen the outside world, 
there was one thing the boy longed for.

00:08:06.710 --> 00:08:12.050
It was the small, round sky 
visible from the manhole.

00:08:12.050 --> 00:08:15.690
He longed to obtain that 
bright, beautiful sky.

00:08:16.270 --> 00:08:20.220
He thought his dream would come 
true if he could just get outside.

00:08:21.210 --> 00:08:26.110
Then suddenly, one day, 
the boy was able to get out.

00:08:26.930 --> 00:08:31.270
His heart overflowed with
hope for this new world.

00:08:31.940 --> 00:08:35.860
However, he was taken to 
a certain institution.

00:08:37.060 --> 00:08:42.340
The place was full of children with 
no place to go, just like the boy.

00:08:42.340 --> 00:08:46.240
There, a world more terrifying than 
the sewers was waiting for the boy.

00:08:46.620 --> 00:08:49.050
The boy was more beautiful 
than the other children,

00:08:49.050 --> 00:08:52.400
so he was given nice clothes and fed good food.

00:08:52.730 --> 00:08:57.280
But, in return, he became the prey of
aristocrats who used money as power,

00:08:57.280 --> 00:08:59.630
and he suffered subhuman treatment.

00:09:02.380 --> 00:09:04.100
In this world...

00:09:14.220 --> 00:09:18.910
There are some who think imperfection 
makes a thing all the more beautiful.

00:09:26.230 --> 00:09:29.140
Why are you making that face?

00:09:30.670 --> 00:09:35.570
How can you speak so cheerfully 
about something so painful?

00:09:39.130 --> 00:09:41.770
Some good things happened, too.

00:09:42.800 --> 00:09:44.500
I obtained brothers.

00:09:45.840 --> 00:09:49.440
It's where I met Ruki-kun and the others.

00:09:50.740 --> 00:09:52.720
I see.

00:09:53.720 --> 00:09:55.190
Hey, masochistic kitten.

00:09:57.050 --> 00:09:58.380
Sleep with me.

00:09:59.880 --> 00:10:01.470
Let's share a bed.

00:10:07.880 --> 00:10:11.380
You cannot obtain anything 
without paying the price.

00:10:11.380 --> 00:10:13.170
No... No!

00:10:14.340 --> 00:10:19.580
That's how the world works. Now, come here.

00:10:18.770 --> 00:10:20.340
You are beautiful...

00:10:20.340 --> 00:10:22.380
You want a better life, don't you?

00:10:21.360 --> 00:10:22.380
Stop!

00:10:22.380 --> 00:10:23.930
No!

00:10:27.270 --> 00:10:28.510
Stop!

00:10:30.450 --> 00:10:31.650
Please, stop.

00:10:33.970 --> 00:10:35.110
Kou-kun?

00:10:37.320 --> 00:10:40.950
No... No...

00:10:41.640 --> 00:10:42.840
Stop!

00:10:54.280 --> 00:10:55.270
No.

00:11:00.290 --> 00:11:01.480
Kou-kun...

00:12:20.060 --> 00:12:23.350
Why aren't you happy with my present?

00:12:23.350 --> 00:12:26.270
Why don't you give me your everything?

00:12:26.270 --> 00:12:29.500
Nothing in this world comes free.

00:12:29.500 --> 00:12:31.530
If you don't know, I'll teach you.

00:12:31.530 --> 00:12:33.800
It's a give-and-take world, you know.

00:12:34.830 --> 00:12:37.850
You want these fangs, right, masochistic kitten?
